          "content": {
            "id": "38837cbc-6a28-3319-b2b6-6c7fa7c07f59",
            "contentType": "VIDEO",
            "title": "Markets may be too 'hardened' to react to gov't shutdown layoffs",
            "description": "<p>The US government has <a data-i13n=\"cpos:1;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/news/a-government-shutdown-begins-after-talks-break-down-040124607.html\">officially shut down</a>.</p>\n<p>Siebert Financial chief investment officer Mark Malek joins Morning Brief host <a data-i13n=\"cpos:2;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/author/julie-hyman/\">Julie Hyman</a> to discuss the shutdown, the possibility of furloughs becoming layoffs, and what it could all mean for markets (<a data-i13n=\"cpos:3;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/%5EDJI\">^DJI</a>, <a data-i13n=\"cpos:4;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/%5EGSPC\">^GSPC</a>,<a data-i13n=\"cpos:5;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/%5EIXIC\"> ^IXIC</a>) and investors.</p>\n<p>To watch more expert insights and analysis on the latest market action, check out more <a data-i13n=\"cpos:6;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/videos/series/morning-brief/\">Morning Brief</a>.</p>",
            "summary": "The US government has officially shut down. Siebert Financial chief investment officer Mark Malek joins Morning Brief host Julie Hyman to discuss the shutdown, the possibility of furloughs becoming layoffs, and what it could all mean for markets (^DJI, ^GSPC, ^IXIC) and investors. To watch more expert insights and analysis on the latest market action, check out more Morning Brief.",
